<title>THAILAND: Thai stocks rally 2.16 pct as support fund buying.</title>
<headline>Thai stocks rally 2.16 pct as support fund buying.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai stocks rallied 2.16 percent in the late afternoon session on Thursday on buying by a private sector rescue fund whose aim was to shore up the market, brokers said.</p>
